  ('ad12276f-e986-572c-8a8b-2c5335bab572', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g9-argument-writing'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which sentence would best replace sentence (13) as a formal conclusion that follows from the argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Anyone who cares more about a view than about birds should be ashamed.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"dismissive-tone"},{"text":"The school should also plant more trees on the hill so birds have places to nest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-topic"},{"text":"In conclusion, birds are important to nature, and people should learn more about them.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-general"},{"text":"Because the film would save many birds at a low cost and keep the view clear, Hollis High should install it.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Because the film would save many birds at a low cost and keep the view clear, Hollis High should install it.$q$, $q$The correct conclusion restates the writer's position and draws on the evidence about bird deaths, cost and the clear view. The general statement about birds drops the writer's actual proposal.$q$, 'draft', '01da2e99-0526-5bce-96ed-454544918009')
