   $q$Which sentence, added after sentence (8), would best strengthen the writer's response to the teachers' concern?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The film can be ordered in several colors, including white, silver and gray.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Many people find a pattern of small dots pleasant and calming to look at.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-generalization"},{"text":"When the Brindle Nature Center measured light before and after installing the film, indoor light dropped by less than five percent.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Bird strikes happen most often during the spring and fall migration seasons.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-counterclaim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$When the Brindle Nature Center measured light before and after installing the film, indoor light dropped by less than five percent.$q$, $q$The teachers worry that the film would darken the classrooms, and the measured light readings answer that worry with evidence. The sentence about migration seasons is true to the topic but says nothing about light or the view.$q$, 'draft', '01da2e99-0526-5bce-96ed-454544918009')
