   $q$Which sentence should be deleted because it is informal and does not support the claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (12)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-supporting-detail"},{"text":"sentence (13)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (10)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-reasoning"},{"text":"sentence (2)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-problem-statement"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (13)$q$, $q$Sentence (13) uses casual language and comments on seat comfort, which has nothing to do with the claim. Sentence (10) should stay because it explains what the cost comparison means.$q$, 'draft', '25e5d099-6c79-527b-ae98-20202416c70a')
